        {
          "text": "Ein Kilo",
          "pos": "phr.",
          "meaning": "a kilo"
        }
      ],
      "id": "t2",
      "en": "A kilo of tomatoes and half a kilo of apples, please."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Verkäufer",
      "role": "npc",
      "text": "Die Äpfel sind heute sehr gut und billig.",
      "glosses": [
        {
          "text": "billig",
          "pos": "adj.",
          "meaning": "cheap"
        }
      ],
      "id": "t3",
      "en": "The apples are very good and cheap today."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "You",
      "role": "you",
      "text": "Prima. Ich brauche auch Gemüse für die Suppe.",
